[Quotes]
victory1 = "Consider yourself ... hexed."
victory2 = "Terribly sorry about that. Maybe you should lay down."
victory3 = "I'm sorry X-Men, but the Avengers need my help to stop the Phoenix."
victory4 = "I don't know who you are, but no one is as powerful as me."
victory5 = "Looks like this spider's been squashed."
victory6 = "Who's side are you on, Logan?"
victory7 = "Guns? Is that your only weapon for fighting me?"
victory8 = "I hope for our sakes, you know what you're doing Cap."
victory9 = "You might want to buff out those dents I put in your armor."
victory10 = "Clearly you're no where near dangerous as the real Hulk."
victory11 = "Maybe you should have called the rest of the Four for backup."
victory12 = "It seems my magic's stronger than yours, Thor."
victory13 = "I hope you learned not to mess with me."
victory14 = "Funny ... I figured you had more fight in you, Carol."
victory15 = "We need you to come with us, Hope. So we can save the world."
victory16 = "You're quite the showoff, Bobby. Try focusing on the fight, though."
victory17 = "Terribly sorry about that. Maybe you should lay down."
victory18 = "Consider yourself ... hexed."
victory19 = "I hope you realize the consequences of starting this war, Scott."
victory20 = "I'm sorry father. I didn't want it to come to this."
victory21 = "You need to learn how to respect women."
victory22 = "I'm sorry Peter, but I can't seem to help you."
victory23 = "I don't want to fight you, but I have to help my team."
victory24 = "You picked your side, Hank. Hope you made the right choice."
victory25 = "Too much power to handle, Rogue?"
victory26 = "All my magic, and I STILL can't get you to be quiet."
victory27 = "Whatever's wrong with you Mar-Vell, it'll have to wait."
victory28 = "Finally, the threat is over."
victory29 = "We can't let anyone stop us! Not even you!"